{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0043682 P-type divalent copper transporter activity\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30958\n\nConsider GO:0140581 P-type monovalent copper transporter activity\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bX8h7QNrx-sp6aOnzEV7ZB9hg1KurYtDaNqb0BXFZtE/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nCGD\t1\nMGI\t5\nReactome\t1\nUniProt\t3\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:0043682\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-3697838 > GO:P-type divalent copper transporter activity ; GO:0043682\nGO:0043682\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-6803545 > GO:P-type divalent copper transporter activity ; GO:0043682\nGO:0043682\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-936802 > GO:P-type divalent copper transporter activity ; GO:0043682\nGO:0043682\treactome2go\tReactome:R-HSA-936895 > GO:P-type divalent copper transporter activity ; GO:0043682\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:49:52Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0043682 P-type divalent copper transporter activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-10-31T00:55:54Z"}
